        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86711, Modern Warwick Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Warwick Door Pull has a sleek look that is well-suited to contemporary homes. This solid brass door pull is available in all the most popular finish colors. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. The Warwick Door Handle comes packaged with the mounting hardware needed to install in on a wood, metal, or composite door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/warwick-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86711\"><b>Warwick Pulls with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Warwick Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DP86711-specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek Warwick Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86711:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86712:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
